       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed (Order ID: ORD-0001): sertraline 600 mg by mouth, once daily.\n\nThe order note says the dose is above the 200 mg/day labeled maximum and that you confirmed it as intended. It also asks for pharmacist verification and monitoring.\n\nBecause of the dose, consider baseline and follow-up ECGs, and watch for serotonin syndrome and seizures. Check for interacting medications as well. I can change the order if you want to adjust it."
